==Battleground==
*1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gorilliam]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
**4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use your typical anti-Alien units such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]]. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] can help control the Gorilliam while your units wreck havoc.

